1cf556df-ba2c-4048-b2aa-842af31e9add submission: {"title":"Crown Opening Statement","text":"Members of the jury, the Crown will present the approved account of Fictional Mira. In E-001, Mira states: \"I saw Fictional Rowan hand the sealed envelope to Fictional Ellis. I do not know what the envelope contained.\" The Crown bears the burden of proving beyond a reasonable doubt that Fictional Ellis received the sealed envelope from Fictional Rowan; no further elements are supplied. E-001 may be used only to attribute Mira's account; it does not prove contents, knowing participation, or guilt."}
308114ca-b138-4925-b176-171eb86296d8 submission: {"title":"Defence Opening Statement","text":"Members of the jury, the single supplied condition is whether Fictional Ellis received a sealed envelope from Fictional Rowan. E-001 records only Mira's account. As the Crown acknowledged, E-001 may be used to attribute Mira's account; it does not prove contents, knowing participation, or guilt. The Crown bears the burden beyond a reasonable doubt, and no further elements are supplied. Mira's approved account does not identify the contents. The Defence asks you to apply the supplied use limit and burden."}
